# DropRevive Worker secrets.
# The Deploy to Cloudflare button asks for every uncommented line below as a secret.
# Each one is required: enter none for a drive you do not use.
# Locally: copy this file to .dev.vars (never commit it).
# After deploy: Workers > your Worker > Settings > Variables and Secrets.
# Step-by-step guide: docs/self-host.md
#
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID: Google OAuth client ID (ends with .apps.googleusercontent.com), or none
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET: Google OAuth client secret, or none
# MS_CLIENT_ID: Azure application (client) ID, or none
# MS_CLIENT_SECRET: Azure client secret Value (expires within 24 months), or none
# DRIVE_COOKIE_KEY: 32 random bytes, base64 (openssl rand -base64 32)
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS: this site's origin(s), comma-separated, e.g. https://droprevive.example.workers.dev
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
MS_CLIENT_ID=
MS_CLIENT_SECRET=
DRIVE_COOKIE_KEY=
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=
